      "body": "**FBC naturality leaves: precise missing layer (post-heart-closure, run 0009 T2; supersedes '4 leaf sorries' notes).** FBC has exactly **3 sorries**, all in `CechHigherDirectImageUnconditional.lean`: the two cosimplicial `naturality` fields (`cech_pushforward_baseChange_natIso` ~1690, `twisted_cech_nerve_iso` ~1758) and `pullback_preservesFiniteLimits` (197). `FlatBaseChange.lean` is sorry-free (mate stubs deleted).\n\n- **The naturality fields are NOT quick wins.** Both components are \u226a\u226b-chains through `pushPull_sigma_iso` + `Pi.mapIso` of per-\u03c3 isos. Missing layer, in order: (1) a transport formula expressing `(CechNerve \ud835\udcb0 F).map \u03c6` through `pushPull_sigma_iso` as a matrix of restrictions `pushPullObj F (Over.mk j_\u03c3) \u27f6 pushPullObj F (Over.mk j_\u03c4)` (only `pushPull_sigma_iso_\u03c0`/`_\u03c0_incl` exist, in `CechSectionIdentificationBase/Leg`); (2) per-\u03c3 restriction compatibility of the heavy per-\u03c3 isos (`pushPullObj_coverInter_baseChange`, `twisted_cech_nerve_per_sigma`) \u2014 coherence through the `AffinePushPullEssImage` essImage/adjoint constructions. Estimate: multi-hundred LOC each; one focused session per leaf at best.\n- **Heart-closure recipe that landed** (session 0011 surgery, verified 0013): paste `restrictedCartesianAffinePushout` onto the ambient square (`IsPullback.paste_vert`), convert with the converse `isPushout_of_isPullback_SpecMap` (`IsPullback.of_map_of_faithful` on `Scheme.Spec`, then `.unop.flip`), identify the pullback corner with `coverInterOpen \ud835\udcb0' \u03c3` via the slice iso, rewrite corner sections (`coverInterOpen_baseChange_restrictedMap_comm` + `pullbackRestrict_iso_tilde` + `pullback_spec_tilde_iso`), finish with `affinePushforwardPullbackBaseChange`. `set_option maxHeartbeats 800000` scoped per declaration suffices.",
